# Upstream commits the sources of NginxionS in openappsec/ were taken from (git subtree, github.com/openappsec/<name>).
# Not used by the builds: they build openappsec/. To take a newer upstream commit:
#   git subtree pull --prefix=openappsec/<dir> https://github.com/openappsec/<name> <commit> --squash
# then settle the conflicts by the "NginxionS:" marks and write the commit here. With OPENAPPSEC_REF, refresh
# nginxions/backend/nginxions/waf/objects/examples/.
